.565,"text":"This is a cartoon. You're describing a cartoon.","words":[{"w":"This","s":188.605,"e":188.925},{"w":"is","s":188.925,"e":189.085},{"w":"a","s":189.085,"e":189.165},{"w":"cartoon.","s":189.165,"e":189.885},{"w":"You're","s":189.885,"e":190.205},{"w":"describing","s":190.205,"e":190.525},{"w":"a","s":190.525,"e":190.765},{"w":"cartoon.","s":190.765,"e":191.565}]},{"speaker":"Alice","start":191.805,"end":199.78,"text":"The army had bitten off more than it could chew. Final tally: nearly ten thousand rounds fired, roughly a thousand emus down.","words":[{"w":"The","s":191.805,"e":192.045},{"w":"army","s":192.045,"e":192.365},{"w":"had","s":192.365,"e":192.525},{"w":"bitten","s":192.525,"e":192.845},{"w":"off","s":192.845,"e":193.085},{"w":"more","s":193.085,"e":193.325},{"w":"than","s":193.325,"e":193.485},{"w":"it","s":193.485,"e":193.565},{"w":"could","s":193.565,"e":193.805},{"w":"chew.","s":193.805,"e":194.045},{"w":"Final","s":194.42,"e":194.9},{"w":"tally:","s":194.9,"e":195.62},{"w":"nearly","s":195.62,"e":195.94},{"w":"ten","s":195.94,"e":196.26},{"w":"thousand","s":196.26,"e":196.66},{"w":"rounds","s":196.66,"e":196.98},{"w":"fired,","s":196.98,"e":197.78},{"w":"roughly","s":197.86,"e":198.18},{"w":"a","s":198.18,"e":198.42},{"w":"thousand","s":198.42,"e":198.66},{"w":"emus","s":198.66,"e":199.22},{"w":"down.","s":199.22,"e":199.78}]},{"speaker":"David","start":199.86,"end":207.54,"text":"So biting off more than you can chew means taking on something too big to handle. Like a bite you literally can't swallow.","words":[{"w":"So","s":199.86,"e":200.1},{"w":"biting","s":200.1,"e":200.58},{"w":"off","s":200.58,"e":200.9},{"w":"more","s":200.9,"e":201.14},{"w":"than","s":201.14,"e":201.38},{"w":"you","s":201.38,"e":201.54},{"w":"can","s":201.54,"e":201.7},{"w":"chew","s":201.7,"e":202.18},{"w":"means","s":202.18,"e":202.74},{"w":"taking","s":202.74,"e":203.22},{"w":"on","s":203.22,"e":203.46},{"w":"something","s":203.46,"e":203.86},{"w":"too","s":203.8